              "text": "Kyokka nkulinako ensonga eno. Ogumiikiriza omukazi Yezeberi eyeeyita nnabbi omukazi akyamya abaweereza bange ng'abayigiriza obwenzi n'okulya emmere eweereddwayo eri bakatonda abalala.",
